起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"frame-sampling\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"3ffbe186-f248-45ad-998b-c5348db0d85a","tool_call_id":"call_b71692278dfa457881b6c35e","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":79,"prompt_tokens":14553,"total_tokens":14632,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":19,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":79},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":14553}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-a243b4b3-9a6b-96db-801f-49a2edcd26b8","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e36-baea-7550-8cb5-246510fb5bfc-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取帧提取技能说明文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_2fe6b378306641da89403d10","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":14553,"output_tokens":79,"total_tokens":14632,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":19}}},{"content":"---\nname: frame-sampling\ndescription: Sample structured frames from an existing video file. Use when Codex has video_path, file_path, raw_segment_uri, camera_id, sampling_strategy, capture_seconds, or provided frame records and needs stable Frame schema outputs. This skill exposes OpenCV-backed real video frame extraction.\n---\n\n# Frame Sampling\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides a video file instead of `frames`, do not ask the user to provide frames and do not write custom OpenCV extraction code. Call this skill directly with `camera_id`, `video_path`/`file_path`/`raw_segment_uri`, `capture_seconds`, and `sampling_strategy`. Use `sampling_strategy.mode=interval` and `interval_seconds=1` as the default unless the user requests a different cadence.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video <video.mp4> --camera-id <camera_id> --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir <run_dir> --config <config.json> --output <frames.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--video`, `--frames-json`, `--camera-id`, `--capture-seconds`, `--interval-seconds`, `--fps`, `--output-dir`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read camera id, local video path, and sampling strategy.\n2. Support interval, fps, keyframe, and adaptive strategies when available.\n3. Generate stable frame ids from camera id, timestamp, and sequence.\n4. Store sampled images and return Frame schema records.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `camera_id`\n\nCommon fields:\n- `raw_segment_uri`\n- `video_path` or `file_path`\n- `started_at`\n- `capture_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.mode`: `interval` or `fps`\n- `sampling_strategy.interval_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.fps`\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `frames`, each with `frame_id`, `camera_id`, `timestamp`, `image_uri`, `width`, `height`, `sequence`, and for real video `source_elapsed_seconds`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_CAMERA_ID`\n- `VIDEO_OPEN_FAILED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not run detection, tracking, event recognition, or evidence annotation.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"5f1ab7f2-4c5b-4f58-973f-cd6cba679c92","tool_call_id":"call_2fe6b378306641da89403d10","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在我来执行帧提取脚本，从视频中提取第5秒的画面。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":288,"prompt_tokens":15240,"total_tokens":15528,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":212,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":288},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":15240}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-0efc02eb-5aec-91e5-9292-538f831e0bd3","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e36-c282-7dd3-b533-f1b8a9eea5b5-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ls /mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py","description":"检查帧提取脚本是否存在"},"id":"call_12a142cb96a7418ca6262819","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":15240,"output_tokens":288,"total_tokens":15528,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":212}}},{"content":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"86e5cbab-c02d-4b73-97ad-2a9f866befcc","tool_call_id":"call_12a142cb96a7418ca6262819","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":156,"prompt_tokens":15343,"total_tokens":15499,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":19,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":156},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":15343}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-58d55325-b116-9320-ba30-3c13771ff79f","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e36-d370-7623-b8a2-2a17b43e8650-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"python /mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video \"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\" --camera-id \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\" --capture-seconds 5 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output\" --output \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames.json\"","description":"执行帧提取脚本，从视频中提取第5秒画面"},"id":"call_69da24f014054de0a6df42aa","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":15343,"output_tokens":156,"total_tokens":15499,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":19}}},{"content":"{\n  \"skill\": \"frame-sampling\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"confidence\": 1.0,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n    \"frames\": [\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 1,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 2,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 1.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000020800_0003\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000020800_0003.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 3,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 2.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000030800_0004\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:03+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000030800_0004.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 4,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 3.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000040800_0005\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:04+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000040800_0005.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 5,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 4.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000050800_0006\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:05+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000050800_0006.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 6,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 5.0\n      }\n    ],\n    \"source_video_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\",\n    \"fps\": 12.0\n  }\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"aed0e467-76b4-43e1-87bd-4ff95b7c43eb","tool_call_id":"call_69da24f014054de0a6df42aa","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"帧提取成功！第5秒的画面已提取。现在我来查看图片并计算其SHA-256哈希值。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":345,"prompt_tokens":16772,"total_tokens":17117,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":126,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":345},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":16772}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-88fdab07-7041-96eb-bac4-df41fcf6b1d9","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e36-e04a-7ed2-a25e-1e1156c013e2-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_image","args":{"image_path":"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000050800_0006.jpg"},"id":"call_6067ace580f94357be8d4928","type":"tool_call"},{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"sha256sum \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_DEERFLOW_001/CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000050800_0006.jpg\"","description":"计算第5秒截图的SHA-256哈希值"},"id":"call_0410a021f0ea4556af0371cd","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":16772,"output_tokens":345,"total_tokens":17117,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":126}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请把这段视频第 5 秒的画面导出成一张证据截图，并给出这张图的哈希值。","normalized_query":"请把这段视频第 5 秒的画面导出成一张证据截图，并给出这张图的哈希值。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将导出这段视频第5秒的画面作为证据截图，并给出该截图的哈希值","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","时间范围":"第 5 秒","输出形式":"截图、哈希值"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_7d6937","text":"请把这段视频第 5 秒的画面导出成一张证据截图，并给出这张图的哈希值。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_15062b","text":"加载输入视频文件并解析其封装格式与时间轴元数据，利用视频解码引擎精确定位至第5秒（5000ms）对应的GOP关键帧索引，输出目标帧的解码位置参数与缓冲流。"},{"task_span_id":"span_48d5d2","text":"基于定位参数调用视频帧提取接口，将第5秒画面渲染为无损静态图像，按电子取证规范添加“证据固定”数字水印或EXIF时间戳标记，输出独立的标准格式截图文件。"},{"task_span_id":"span_73ad21","text":"将生成的截图文件输入至密码学哈希计算管道，采用SHA-256算法对完整二进制流执行单向散列运算，生成防篡改的哈希值字符串并输出计算校验日志。"},{"task_span_id":"span_276628","text":"汇总证据截图文件、SHA-256哈希值及关联元数据，按多智能体协同交付协议打包为结构化任务响应，明确标注文件路径、哈希算法类型与证据有效性声明，完成闭环输出。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_e88125","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将导出这段视频第5秒的画面作为证据截图，并给出该截图的哈希值。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","时间范围":"第 5 秒","输出形式":"截图、哈希值"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_e88125","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将导出这段视频第5秒的画面作为证据截图，并给出该截图的哈希值。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","时间范围":"第 5 秒","输出形式":"截图、哈希值"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:6fd76559-303d-470a-bd03-b0ca03ab6091"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n请把这段视频第 5 秒的画面导出成一张证据截图，并给出这张图的哈希值。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n请把这段视频第 5 秒的画面导出成一张证据截图，并给出这张图的哈希值。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment